#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "40300"
msgid "#C236196003Sakura#CDEF is right.\nLet's head back to #C000246204My Room#CDEF now."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "40836"
msgid "#C236196003BB#CDEF is right there.\nLet's #C000246204press on#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "41856"
msgid "We obtained the #C000246204SG#CDEF.\nLet's go back to #C000246204My Room#CDEF and rest."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "42148"
msgid "Apocalypse Now!\nCome back soooooooon!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "42616"
msgid "Surely you aren't thinking of WALKING back?\nDo you intend to make me march for no purpose?\nLook for that #C000246204checkpoint#CDEF!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "43528"
msgid "#C236196003#SVT#CDEF is right.\nLet's head back to #C000246204My Room#CDEF and get some rest."
msgstr ""

#. unk_op1659
msgctxt "47756"
msgid "　Obtained\n#C000246204#TITM0001#CDEF."
msgstr "　Obtido:\n#C000246204#TITM0001#CDEF."

#. popupStd_line1
msgctxt "47800"
msgid "Obtained"
msgstr "Obtido"

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "598668"
msgid "I lighty touch the Relief before me."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "598708"
msgid "It feels cold to the touch.\nApparently this Relief is #C236196003Rani#CDEF's mind itself,\nbut I wonder if #C236196003Rani#CDEF's mind is cold like this Relief."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "599088"
msgid "Don't worry. I'll protect you, Darling.\nSo keep moving forward."
msgstr ""

#. choice
msgctxt "599304"
msgid "Stay here."
msgstr ""

#. popupStd
msgctxt "599660"
msgid "Checkpoint unlocked."
msgstr ""

#. inDungeon
msgctxt "599980"
msgid "Let us search as deep as we can.\nBe careful not to miss any clues."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "600292"
msgid "That's #C236196003Rani#CDEF's True Self――\nClearly, the Core of the Labyrinth."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "600572"
msgid "The goal already? This is nothing but a trap.\nDarling, be careful."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "600744"
msgid "#C236196003#SVT#CDEF is right."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "600972"
msgid "#C236196003Rani#CDEF must understand this, so why did she\nshape the Labyrinth like this?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "601076"
msgid "The reason is obvious. I have no #C000246204SG#CDEF.\nThus, there's no reason to hide or fight."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "601176"
msgid "Nyahaha. That's what this girl said last time."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "601620"
msgid "―――Let me be frank:\nyour gradual progress ends here,\n#[Mr.][Ms.]##C236196003 #NICK#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "602504"
msgid "Gh… You need to humiliate #C236196003Rani#CDEF somehow,\n#C236196003#NICK#CDEF!\nA girl without secrets doesn't exist!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "602740"
msgid "Totally. Such a shame about #C236196003Rin#CDEF.\nBe honest, you had mo' #C000246204SGs#CDEF, right?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "602868"
msgid "G-gh… Whose side are you two on!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "603428"
msgid "I nod, \"Yeah, it is.\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "603456"
msgid "For a second, #C236196003Rani#CDEF's eyes looked like amethysts\nas they sparkled with joy like a child."
msgstr ""

#. choice
msgctxt "603604"
msgid "Want the chess set?"
msgstr ""

#. choice
msgctxt "603624"
msgid "Do you like chess?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "603644"
msgid "I don't want it. I have my own chess set.\nIt's in good taste for a woman of science\nto have."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "603796"
msgid "Did you know?\nIndia holds some of the oldest known origins\nof chess in the world."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "603880"
msgid "My nationality isn't of India, but my\nmentor who created me seemed to have an\nattachment to that country."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "603992"
msgid "By the way… If you have this much free time,\nthen how about playing a game with me?\nI'm pretty free as well right now."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "604128"
msgid "…an unexpected offer."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "604268"
msgid "I shouldn't need to mention this, but if\nyou win, you won't be able to obtain an #C000246204SG#CDEF.\nThis is just a demonstration."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "604468"
msgid "To do so, a fair and impartial game is\npreferable."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "604564"
msgid "Reflexes, stamina―no impact. Starting on equal\nterms. Plays made only through the fluidity of\nour thought. It's the universe's fairest game."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "604756"
msgid "A fair game, huh… but we just don't have the\ntime for it.\nOn average, it takes an hour to play."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "604876"
msgid "It's hard to think that this is anything\nbut a strategy to waste our time."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "605152"
msgid "No matter how long we take, the passage of time\nin reality will be negligible. We can freely\nimmerse ourselves in thought experiments."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "605608"
msgid "Beautiful choice.\nThen let's start without delay."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "605660"
msgid "L-lost in ONE SECOND!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "606028"
msgid "And she loses in ONE SECOND!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "606172"
msgid "#C236196003Saber#CDEF is talking tough, but her exhausted voice says it all."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "606416"
msgid "Certainly. I'll take any challenger."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "606756"
msgid "Hmmm."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "606768"
msgid "Exaggerating, I see."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "606796"
msgid "Oh, boy… I really feel like passing on this\none, but I have to vindicate my Darling\nof this disgrace."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "606920"
msgid "So then, #C236196003Rani#CDEF.\nWill you grant me a single game?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "606988"
msgid "I knew I would give up after an hour. Hmm.\nThere would be a bit more thinking involved if\nthis was Go; but AI are unrivaled in chess."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "607224"
msgid "The vain #C236196003Gilgamesh#CDEF spits out,\narms firmly crossed."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "607312"
msgid "………well, easy to say―from the sidelines."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "607828"
msgid "NO WAY! That gildy guy is actually SMART!?\nDoes he not think at human speed!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "608264"
msgid "It's my loss.\nHowever, it was an obvious thing."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "608684"
msgid "The result was loss after loss.\nEven #C236196003Leo#CDEF was unable to topple #C236196003Rani#CDEF's king."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "608840"
msgid "…are there no more challengers?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "608876"
msgid "None.\nThere's no way anyone around here has an\noptimal strategy to beat you."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "608980"
msgid "None.\nThere's no way anyone other than #C236196003Gil#CDEF has an\noptimal strategy to beat you."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "610144"
msgid "Hoooolllddd iitttt!\nYou're not facing #C236196003#GIVEN#CDEF THIS time!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "610624"
msgid "Umm… #C236196003Leo#CDEF? Is this okay?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "610676"
msgid "Why not?\nThere's no penalty if he loses this game.\n#C236196003Shinji#CDEF may have a chance to win."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "610792"
msgid "Bleh… It might be true if #C236196003Leo#CDEF\nsays so, but…… really?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "610944"
msgid "On my pride as a human player,\nI won't be losing to an AI just yet."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "611112"
msgid "This one was rather lengthy…!\nWho won? #C236196003Rani#CDEF or #C236196003Shinji#CDEF!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "611428"
msgid "Did he―――really beat her!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "611464"
msgid "……that was quite a game.\nOn a best-of-three point system,\nI won two straight games."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "611576"
msgid "……"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "611688"
msgid "Ooof course."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "611812"
msgid "Mhm. So my kingliness detector\nWAS malfunctioning."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "611964"
msgid "The legendary Game Champ \"UME\" said those\nwords too…!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "612356"
msgid "…………"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "612824"
msgid "It was worth seeing this unexpected side of\n#C236196003Shinji#CDEF, but our situation still hasn't changed."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "613836"
msgid "Yep. I'll be winning by objective judgement,\nnot subjective. If I get lucky, of course."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "614240"
msgid "#C236196003Rani#CDEF, I heard that you said, \"chess is\nthe ultimate game,\" but a game like chess\nis unequal, see?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "614356"
msgid "What are you saying?\nChess is a fair, equal game."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "614524"
msgid "It's unequal, yo. No matter how \"even\"\na game's system is, the players going at it\nhave different levels of skill."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "615308"
msgid "………#C236196003Jinako Carigiri#CDEF.\nIf you insist so, then let's have a match\nin a game YOU consider fair."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "616376"
msgid "…………………"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "616536"
msgid "……………that's brooding, alright.\nThe point #C236196003Jinako#CDEF made antithesizes #C236196003Leo#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "617148"
msgid "That means #C236196003Rani#CDEF won. In total, #C236196003Rani#CDEF dominated.\nShe proved that she has luck AND is invincible."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "617280"
msgid "And yet―――\nWhy does she look so frustrated, I wonder…?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "618264"
msgid "…that absolutely can't be.\nI play fair games!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "618312"
msgid "Another 200 rounds, then?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "618348"
msgid "………………"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "618604"
msgid "That chess set was on this floor. The one game\nyou specialize in, or rather, you always win at,\nand you purposefully laid it out for us～"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "619000"
msgid "Not having an #C000246204SG#CDEF is total BS. This floor itself\nis your mind, #C236196003Rani#CDEF. #C236196003#NICK#CDEF, tell it to\nher straight up."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "619284"
msgid "Aa, aaah, ah―――!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "619308"
msgid "Nyahaha! This is #C236196003Rani#CDEF's final #C000246204SG#CDEF…\n#C236196003Jinako#CDEF hereby dubs this, [#C000246204Powergamer#CDEF]!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "619492"
msgid "That's… my final secret.\n…I see. I still had a bias I was unable\nto analyze."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "619588"
msgid "…fine then. I will admit that I\ncraved the spotlight.\nHowever―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "620724"
msgid "Oh boy… the final #C236196003Rani#CDEF went totally ballistic…\n\"Powergamer\" is quite a dishonorable\ntitle, huh…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "621300"
msgid "Yes, no doubt. However, to break that wall\nwe must beat #C236196003Rani#CDEF and sever her free from #C236196003BB#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. choice
msgctxt "622188"
msgid "Enter Rani's mind now."
msgstr ""

#. choice
msgctxt "622212"
msgid "Prepare some more."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "622232"
msgid "I understand. #C236196003Sakura#CDEF.\nJust like before, please give your support."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "622320"
msgid "Yes, please leave it to me. I've grasped onto\n#C236196003#GIVEN#CDEF's biograph and soulgraph."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "623024"
msgid "Then as soon as you're ready, please come to me.\nI'll wait for you here."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "623164"
msgid "Welcome back.\nThat was a deft subdual."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "623440"
msgid "I shall take her to the old school.\n#C236196003#FAMILY#CDEF, please continue on further."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "623532"
msgid "Yes. Allow my Praetor to secure the exit.\nTake care of #C236196003Rani#CDEF, #C236196003Sessyoin#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "624088"
msgid "…that's right."
msgstr ""

